<!--
  v0.5.1 §F-drawables — per-category notification small icon: MED (a capsule / pill).
  Do NOT rename: NotificationUtils.smallIconFor() references R.drawable.ic_notif_med.

  Constraints (see ic_notification.xml's header):
    - a small icon SystemUI cannot inflate makes the WHOLE notification vanish, silently;
    - flat white silhouette only: android:fillColor="#FFFFFFFF" on solid closed paths,
      NO strokeColor / strokeWidth;
    - 24dp x 24dp, viewport 24x24, glyph inset from every edge (some OEMs circle-mask);
    - rounded ends are cubic beziers, NOT elliptical arcs — no degenerate arcs. The 0.6-unit
      gap at x=12 reads as the capsule seam.
  NavIconInflateTest.notifMed() inflates this against a real Resources.
-->
